        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 76029, Fleur De Lis 18 Inch Wrought Steel Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 18 Inch Fleur De Lis Door Pull is made out of wrought steel and is available with either a flat black steel or satin steel finish. Both of these finishes have a rough texture to mimic that found on naturally weathered metal for an old world look. The Fleur De Lis 18 Inch Wrought Steel Door Handle comes packaged with the mounting hardware to surface mount it. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door..\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/24-inch-fleur-de-lis-door-pull-emtek-76041\"><b>Fleur De Lis 24 Inch Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Fleur De Lis 18 Inch Wrought Steel Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Wrought Steel</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 14-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with #10, 1” Wood Screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually with surface mounting.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-Wrought-Steel-finish.jpg?v=1704354509\" width=\"351\" height=\"184\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
